    "id": "albrand/ai-config-kit/qa-sweep",
    "name": "qa-sweep",
    "description": "Use in repos with a committed .qa/config.json before shipping (git push, gh pr create/merge, bb fleet validate, any deploy), and whenever a workflow walk finds defects. Covers the full pipeline the ship-gate enforces: scope the workflow (P0), walk it end to end and inventory EVERY defect without fixing anything (P1, including defects that predate your change), cluster them by root cause with a repro that has failed once (P2), write one plan (P3), fix per cluster in a batch (P4), close the inventory, re-walk the whole workflow once at the batch head (P5), then ship (P6). The gate denies protected shipping until the pipeline is complete.\n",
